{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sudoku Pro offers a calming yet stimulating experience, where each solved puzzle brings a sense of accomplishment. With every move, you'll feel focused and relaxed, making it the perfect way to unwind while exercising your mind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586880/extras/03df876e098e01e77a76c365dbd83053.poster.avif?t=1757337164\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586880/extras/03df876e098e01e77a76c365dbd83053.webm?t=1757337164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586880/extras/03df876e098e01e77a76c365dbd83053.mp4?t=1757337164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Sudoku Pro</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudoku Pro offers a soothing yet challenging puzzle experience designed to test your logic and concentration. Whether you're a beginner or an expert, every solved puzzle brings a sense of accomplishment and mental clarity. With endless puzzles to solve, the game provides a perfect balance of relaxation and mental stimulation, allowing you to play at your own pace in a distraction-free environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586880/extras/754a11c9652fc446bc36c32822bdcb50.poster.avif?t=1757337164\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586880/extras/754a11c9652fc446bc36c32822bdcb50.webm?t=1757337164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586880/extras/754a11c9652fc446bc36c32822bdcb50.mp4?t=1757337164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring the classic 9x9 grid divided into 3x3 regions, Sudoku Pro offers dynamically generated puzzles with multiple difficulty levels to suit all skill levels. A built-in hint system helps you when you're stuck, while progress tracking lets you monitor your improvement over time. Whether you're looking to sharpen your mind or simply unwind, Sudoku Pro delivers an immersive and rewarding puzzle-solving experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586880?t=1757337164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586880?t=1757337164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586880/cc9770834f333f971af84887876d76dcba85adf9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757337164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586880/cc9770834f333f971af84887876d76dcba85adf9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757337164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Sudoku Pro</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586880/extras/428d8fd2d80be09c021127f2749de56f.avif?t=1757337164\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sudoku Pro offers a calming yet stimulating experience, where each solved puzzle brings a sense of accomplishment. With every move, you'll feel focused and relaxed, making it the perfect way to unwind while exercising your mind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><v